<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia names two new wool board members.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia names two new wool board members.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australian government on Friday named two new board members to Wool International and the Australian Wool Research and Promotion Organisation (AWRAP).</p>
<p>Wool grower Keith Campbell was appointed to the Wool International board and Barry Walker, also a wool grower, was appointed to AWRAP's board, Primary Industries Minister John Anderson said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Canberra Bureau 61-6 273-2730</p>
